@startuml
[*] --> System Ready
System Ready -> Create New List : create new list
System Ready -> Access Existing List : access existing list
Create New List -> List Created : list created
Access Existing List -> List Accessed : list accessed
List Created -> Item Added : add item
List Accessed -> Item Added : add item
Item Added -> Item Tagged : tag item
Item Added -> Item Filtered : filter items
Item Tagged -> Item Filtered : filter items
Item Filtered -> Item Sorted : sort items
Item Filtered -> Item Removed : remove item
Item Sorted -> Item Filtered : filter items
Item Sorted -> Item Removed : remove item
Item Removed -> [*] : exit
Item Removed -> Item Filtered : continue
@enduml
